													"patching_rect" : [ 6.0, 67.0, 317.0, 342.0 ],
													"text" : "post processing pass for depth based fog\n\nthe backGroundFog value is how much the fog influences the background / skybox.\n\nWorks with objects with a material on them. \n\nNeeds a TAA pass at the end of the pass chain to fix depth precision issues\n\nyou can choose the fog color, start and range (relative to the camera distance)\n\nif you have a chain of \"pass\" try put it at the end\n\nit is a pass, you place it in your patch and it will automatically effect the look of the final render, you don't need to connect it to anything as it automatically couples with the 3dWorld\n\nif you want to have more \"pass\" effects\nyou chain them connecting the 2nd outlet of the jit.gl.pass with the first inlet of the following jit.gl.pass\n\ncheck the helpfile of the jit.gl.pass for more info"
												}

											}
